{"id":"c-fp-acct-01","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"さっき警察から電話があって、私の口座が犯罪に使われてるって言うのよ。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-02","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"警察署の人だって言う電話でね、あなたの名義の口座が詐欺に使われてますって。わたし何もしてないのに。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-03","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"知らない人が私のキャッシュカードを使ってお金を引き出してるって、警察の人が言ってきたの。カードを確認したいから暗証番号を教えてって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-04","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"捜査をしてたら、私の名前の通帳が見つかったんですって。犯人グループが持ってたって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-05","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"さっき、東京の警視庁の人から電話があって、あなたの口座がマネーロンダリングに使われてるから調べないといけないって言われたんだけど。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-06","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"銀行の人から電話って言うから出たら、すぐ警察に代わって、口座が悪用されてるから今から調べるって言うの。どうしたらいいかしら。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-07","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"あなたの携帯電話の契約が犯罪に使われてますって言われて、その後、口座も止まるかもしれないって。怖くなっちゃって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-08","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"逮捕された犯人が私の名前を言ってるんですって。私は関係ないって言ったんだけど、調べるからお金の動きを教えてって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-09","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"潔白を証明したいなら、口座にあるお金を全部調べさせてくださいって警察の人が。調べたらすぐ返すって言うの。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-acct-10","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"私のマイナンバーが悪いことに使われたらしくて、それで口座も調べなきゃいけないって、警察署って名乗る人が言うのよ。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
